<ui:UXML xmlns:ui="UnityEngine.UIElements" xmlns:uie="UnityEditor.UIElements" xsi:schemaLocation="UnityEngine.UIElements ../../UIElementsSchema/UnityEngine.UIElements.xsd" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" editor-extension-mode="False">
    <Style src="project:/Assets/UI/Styles/GlobalStyles.uss" />
    <ui:VisualElement name="root" class="bg-gradient" style="flex-grow: 1; padding: 40px;">
        <!-- HUD -->
        <ui:VisualElement name="hud" style="flex-direction: row; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 50px;">
            <ui:VisualElement name="p1-info" class="card" style="flex-direction: row; align-items: center; padding: 20px 40px; border-radius: 20px;">
                <ui:Label text="ME" style="color: #444; font-size: 24px; margin-right: 15px;" />
                <ui:Label name="p1-score" text="0" style="color: #4a148c; font-size: 48px; -unity-font-style: bold;" />
            </ui:VisualElement>
            
            <ui:VisualElement name="timer-container" style="align-items: center;">
                <ui:Label name="timer-text" text="03:00" style="color: white; font-size: 54px; -unity-font-style: bold;" />
                <ui:VisualElement name="timer-bar" class="progress-container" style="width: 250px; height: 15px; margin-top: 5px;">
                    <ui:VisualElement name="timer-fill" class="progress-fill" style="width: 100%;" />
                </ui:VisualElement>
            </ui:VisualElement>

            <ui:VisualElement name="p2-info" class="card" style="flex-direction: row; align-items: center; padding: 20px 40px; border-radius: 20px;">
                <ui:Label name="p2-score" text="0" style="color: #4a148c; font-size: 48px; -unity-font-style: bold;" />
                <ui:Label text="OPP" style="color: #444; font-size: 24px; margin-left: 15px;" />
            </ui:VisualElement>
        </ui:VisualElement>

        <!-- QUESTION AREA -->
        <ui:VisualElement name="question-area" style="flex-grow: 1; justify-content: center; align-items: center;">
            <ui:Label name="question-counter" text="CAU 1 / 10" style="color: #ffea00; font-size: 32px; margin-bottom: 20px;" />
            <ui:VisualElement class="card" style="width: 100%; max-width: 900px; min-height: 250px; justify-content: center; align-items: center; padding: 40px;">
                <ui:Label name="question-text" text="Cau hoi dang duoc tai...?" style="color: #212121; font-size: 48px; -unity-text-align: middle-center; -unity-font-style: bold;" />
            </ui:VisualElement>
        </ui:VisualElement>

        <!-- ANSWERS GRID -->
        <ui:VisualElement name="answers-grid" style="margin-top: 50px;">
            <ui:VisualElement style="flex-direction: row; justify-content: space-around; margin-bottom: 20px;">
                <ui:Button name="ans-0" text="DA 1" class="btn" style="flex-grow: 1; height: 140px; font-size: 36px;" />
                <ui:Button name="ans-1" text="DA 2" class="btn" style="flex-grow: 1; height: 140px; font-size: 36px;" />
            </ui:VisualElement>
            <ui:VisualElement style="flex-direction: row; justify-content: space-around;">
                <ui:Button name="ans-2" text="DA 3" class="btn" style="flex-grow: 1; height: 140px; font-size: 36px;" />
                <ui:Button name="ans-3" text="DA 4" class="btn" style="flex-grow: 1; height: 140px; font-size: 36px;" />
            </ui:VisualElement>
        </ui:VisualElement>
    </ui:VisualElement>
</ui:UXML>
